# Keybed verification: black keys = lane select (steady LED), white keys = step toggle,
# playhead scrolls across white keys while playing. All of this is PRE-EXISTING Felucca/X0X
# code (drum_key/drum_step/leds() in ui.c); this scenario proves it, it adds nothing new.
wait 3700
expect splash 0
expect view 1
expect part 0

# black key 2: select track 2 (CH on the 909) and confirm via the sel probe
tapkey b2
expect sel 2

# light two white steps on that track so the playhead has both an on-step and an off-step to cross
tapkey w0
tapkey w4
leds

# start playback, then snapshot the keybed LED state at two different points in the bar
tap PLAY
wait 90
leds
wait 120
leds
